    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/dca8be45f1cdebf2155cc11c45a82cff.avif?t=1749856721\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chick Game</i>\u00a0is a 3D first-person adventure where you play as Jeremy, a devoted rooster on a humble chicken farm. By day, you'll forage for food and care for your beloved hens\u2014but when night falls, the real challenge begins. Waves of predators descend on the coop, and it's up to Jeremy to defend his flock. Each night brings new threats, but with the strength he builds during the day, Jeremy transforms into his powerful Mega Rooster form to take on the invaders. Protect your hens, survive the nights, and become the ultimate guardian of the coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Day Time:</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/92c62245c0633b34843f3dd8c8b27cf6.avif?t=1749856721\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Night Time:</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/66c4c8acb4079be0699bc63770ab2222.avif?t=1749856721\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/dca8be45f1cdebf2155cc11c45a82cff.avif?t=1749856721\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chick Game</i>\u00a0is a 3D first-person adventure where you play as Jeremy, a devoted rooster on a humble chicken farm. By day, you'll forage for food and care for your beloved hens\u2014but when night falls, the real challenge begins. Waves of predators descend on the coop, and it's up to Jeremy to defend his flock. Each night brings new threats, but with the strength he builds during the day, Jeremy transforms into his powerful Mega Rooster form to take on the invaders. Protect your hens, survive the nights, and become the ultimate guardian of the coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Day Time:</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/92c62245c0633b34843f3dd8c8b27cf6.avif?t=1749856721\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Night Time:</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/66c4c8acb4079be0699bc63770ab2222.avif?t=1749856721\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
